Rhen [neutral]: That one's snapped clean through. Nobody's put up a new one? #line:ch03_bark_causeway_posts_001
Toma [neutral]: Nobody mends the posts. #line:ch03_bark_causeway_posts_002
Rhen [neutral]: Why not? #line:ch03_bark_causeway_posts_003
Toma [neutral]: Mind the shells, Rhen. They cut. #line:ch03_bark_causeway_posts_004
